# Infura documentation

Infura API reference, guides, and dashboard documentation are published at [docs.infura.io](https://docs.infura.io/).

- **Repository:** [INFURA/docs.infura](https://github.com/INFURA/docs.infura)
- **Dashboard:** [app.infura.io](https://app.infura.io/)

When MetaMask product docs need to reference Infura:

- Use absolute links to `https://docs.infura.io/` (for example, `https://docs.infura.io/dashboard/get-started/create-api/`).
- Do not recreate Infura content under `services/` or `developer-tools/dashboard/` in this repository.
- For testnet ETH, link to the [Infura faucet](https://www.infura.io/faucet). The MetaMask faucet at
  `/developer-tools/faucet/` is deprecated and redirects there.

Cross-domain redirects in `vercel.json` send legacy `/services/*`, `/developer-tools/dashboard/*`,
and `/developer-tools/faucet/` URLs to Infura. List specific rules before the catch-all fallbacks;
map renamed paths (for example `/services/gas-api/` → `https://docs.infura.io/reference/gas-api/`).
The deprecated faucet path `/developer-tools/faucet/` redirects to `https://www.infura.io/faucet`.
